msgstr "重設所有偏好設定"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:873 setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:870 setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_editor.py:1287 setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_shortcuts.py:722
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "重設為預設值"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:889
msgid "Add custom tool"
msgstr "加入自訂工具"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:919
msgid "Tool name (unique)"
msgstr "工具名稱（唯一）"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:923
msgid "Executable (such as aider)"
msgstr "可執行檔（例如 aider）"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:927
msgid "Headed command template"
msgstr "有頭指令範本"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_appearance.py:929
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Space-separated args. Use {prompt} / {file} / {cwd} as placeholders. Example: aider --message {prompt} --no-auto-commits. If left blank or without {prompt}, the prompt is copied to clipboard."
msgstr "以空格分隔的引數。使用 {prompt} / {file} / {cwd} 作為佔位符。例如：aider --message {prompt} --no-auto-commits。如果留空或不包含 {prompt}，提示資訊將複製到剪貼簿。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:163
msgid "PhiTeX rebuilds as you type, which needs each edit written to disk first — auto build is always on for it."
msgstr "PhiTeX 會隨輸入重建，而這需要每次編輯先寫入磁碟——因此一律開啟自動建置。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:165
msgid "PhiTeX uses a short fixed delay: an incremental rebuild takes about 20 ms, so a longer wait only delays the preview."
msgstr "PhiTeX 使用一段較短的固定延遲：增量重建約需 20 毫秒，等得更久只會拖慢預覽。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:168
msgid "A running PhiTeX session needs the helper files it writes (.aux, .toc, .bbl) to know what an edit affects, so they are kept."
msgstr "執行中的 PhiTeX 工作階段需要它寫出的輔助檔案（.aux、.toc、.bbl）來判斷一次編輯影響到哪些部分，因此會保留這些檔案。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:171
msgid "With a PhiTeX session the build log never pops up on its own: errors show as squiggles in the text and highlighted areas in the preview."
msgstr "使用 PhiTeX 工作階段時建置紀錄不會自動彈出：錯誤以內文中的波浪線與預覽裡的高亮區域呈現。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:173
msgid "Auto build is turned off."
msgstr "自動建置已關閉。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:280
msgid "Output chain only applies when latexmk builds the document."
msgstr "輸出鏈僅在 latexmk 建置文件時生效。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:453
msgid "Changing this ends the running PhiTeX session; the next build starts a new one with the new setting."
msgstr "變更此項會結束執行中的 PhiTeX 工作階段；下一次建置會依新設定啟動新的工作階段。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:471
msgid "Install PhiTeX on this computer for me: https://github.com/accl-kaust/PhiTeX — a separately built TeX engine I want to use as the LaTeX interpreter in NeoSetzer. Choose whatever is appropriate for this operating system, verify what you download, and install it so that `phitex` is on PATH for my user account without sudo and without writing into system directories. Then check it works and show me what you did. Do not compile PhiTeX into NeoSetzer or bundle it in a NeoSetzer package."
msgstr "請幫我在這台電腦上安裝 PhiTeX：https://github.com/accl-kaust/PhiTeX —— 它是獨立建置的 TeX 引擎，我想在 NeoSetzer 中作為 LaTeX 解譯器使用。請選擇適合此作業系統的方式，驗證您下載的內容，並安裝到讓我的使用者帳號下的 `phitex` 出現在 PATH 中，勿使用 sudo，也不要寫入系統目錄。完成後確認它能運作，並告知您做了什麼。請勿將 PhiTeX 編譯進 NeoSetzer 或打包進 NeoSetzer 的安裝套件。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:502
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "找不到"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:529
msgid "Could not change PhiTeX’s update check setting."
msgstr "無法變更 PhiTeX 的更新檢查設定。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:541
msgid "Upgrade PhiTeX?"
msgstr "要升級 PhiTeX 嗎？"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:542
msgid "PhiTeX will download its latest release, verify it and replace its own binary. NeoSetzer does not download anything. Running sessions are ended so the next build uses the new version."
msgstr "PhiTeX 會下載它的最新發行版、驗證並取代自己的二進位檔。NeoSetzer 不下載任何內容。執行中的工作階段會被結束，以便下一次建置使用新版本。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:544 setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:700
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升級"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:564
#, python-brace-format
msgid "PhiTeX upgraded: {message}"
msgstr "PhiTeX 已升級：{message}"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:565
msgid "PhiTeX upgraded."
msgstr "PhiTeX 已升級。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:567
msgid "PhiTeX could not be upgraded: the command did not run."
msgstr "PhiTeX 無法升級：指令未能執行。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:569
#, python-brace-format
msgid "PhiTeX could not be upgraded: {message}"
msgstr "PhiTeX 升級失敗：{message}"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:626
msgid "Build system"
msgstr "建置系統"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:630
msgid "LaTeX interpreter"
msgstr "LaTeX 解譯器"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:644
msgid ""
"No LaTeX interpreter found. To install interpreters in Flatpak, open a terminal and run the following command:\n"
"flatpak install org.freedesktop.Sdk.Extension.texlive"
msgstr ""
"找不到 LaTeX 解譯器。若要在 Flatpak 中安裝解譯器，請開啟終端機並執行以下命令：\n"
"flatpak install org.freedesktop.Sdk.Extension.texlive"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:647
msgid "No LaTeX interpreter found. For instructions on installing LaTeX see <a href=\"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/LaTeX/Installation\">https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/LaTeX/Installation</a>"
msgstr "找不到 LaTeX 解譯器。有關安裝 LaTeX 的說明，請參閱 <a href=\"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/LaTeX/Installation\">https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/LaTeX/Installation</a>"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:648
msgid "Please note: the Tectonic backend uses only the V1 command-line interface. Tectonic.toml configuration files are ignored. For custom build configuration, switch to another interpreter (see the <a href=\"https://tectonic-typesetting.github.io/tectonic/\">Tectonic documentation</a>)."
msgstr "請注意：Tectonic 後端僅使用 V1 命令列介面，Tectonic.toml 設定檔會被忽略。若需自訂建置設定，請切換至其他解譯器（請參閱 <a href=\"https://tectonic-typesetting.github.io/tectonic/\">Tectonic 文件</a>）。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:652
msgid "PhiTeX builds once to a fixpoint (BibTeX, biber and makeindex included), so the latexmk options below do not apply. Its PDF is byte-identical to pdfLaTeX’s, but LuaLaTeX is not supported yet."
msgstr "PhiTeX 一次建置到不動點（含 BibTeX、biber 與 makeindex），因此下方的 latexmk 選項不適用。其 PDF 與 pdfLaTeX 逐位元組一致，但尚不支援 LuaLaTeX。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:655 setzer/dialogs/project_build_configuration_viewgtk.py:225
msgid "Interpreter"
msgstr "LaTeX 解譯器"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:662
msgid "Install PhiTeX"
msgstr "安裝 PhiTeX"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:663
msgid "Not found on this machine. Copy the instructions and hand them to an AI agent — it will fetch and verify the release for your platform."
msgstr "此電腦未找到。複製這段說明交給 AI Agent，它會為您的平台下載並驗證發布套件。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:667 setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:671
msgid "Copy the installation instructions to the clipboard"
msgstr "複製安裝說明至剪貼簿"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:681
msgid "PhiTeX"
msgstr "PhiTeX"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:687
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:691
msgid "Let PhiTeX check for updates"
msgstr "允許 PhiTeX 檢查更新"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:692
msgid "PhiTeX checks at most once a day, on its own, from its own binary. NeoSetzer never downloads or queries anything for it."
msgstr "PhiTeX 每天最多一次、由它自己的二進位檔自行檢查。NeoSetzer 從不為此下載或查詢任何內容。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:696
msgid "Upgrade to the latest release"
msgstr "升級到最新發行版"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:699
msgid "PhiTeX downloads and verifies its own release. NeoSetzer only runs the command."
msgstr "PhiTeX 自行下載並校驗其發行版。NeoSetzer 只負責執行該命令。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:706
msgid "Running PhiTeX sessions are ended after an upgrade, so the next build starts on the new version."
msgstr "升級後會結束執行中的 PhiTeX 工作階段，下一次建置即使用新版本。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:714
msgid "Remove helper files after building"
msgstr "建置後移除輔助檔案"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:716
msgid "The .log, .dvi and similar helper files are deleted once the PDF is built."
msgstr "PDF 建置完成後，.log、.dvi 等同類輔助檔案會被刪除。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:724
msgid "Keep a PhiTeX session running"
msgstr "保持 PhiTeX 工作階段常駐執行"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:725
msgid "Rebuild only what the edit affects by reusing one running PhiTeX process per document. Turning this off re-starts PhiTeX for every build, which recompiles the whole document each time."
msgstr "每個文件複用一個常駐的 PhiTeX 程序，僅重建編輯影響到的部分。關閉後每次建置都會重新啟動 PhiTeX，每次都要完整重編譯整份文件。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:735
msgid "Precise SyncTeX in the background"
msgstr "背景精確 SyncTeX"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:736
msgid "While PhiTeX live preview is active, regenerate SyncTeX with the native TeX engine in the background for accurate jumping. Jumping is briefly unavailable while it updates."
msgstr "PhiTeX 即時預覽啟用時，在背景用原生 TeX 引擎重新產生 SyncTeX，實現精確跳轉。更新期間跳轉短暫無法使用。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:744
msgid "Output chain"
msgstr "輸出環境"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:747
msgid "Needed by PSTricks and psfrag; the interpreter choice is bypassed on this route."
msgstr "PSTricks 與 psfrag 需要此路線；該路線會略過所選擇的解譯器。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:749
msgid "Direct PDF"
msgstr "直接 PDF"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:750
msgid "PDF via PostScript (DVI → dvips → ps2pdf)"
msgstr "透過 PostScript 生成 PDF（DVI → dvips → ps2pdf）"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:756
msgid "Generate SyncTeX for preview sync"
msgstr "生成 SyncTeX 用於預覽同步"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:757
msgid "Enables forward/reverse sync between editor and PDF preview. Disabling makes builds slightly faster."
msgstr "啟用編輯器與 PDF 預覽之間的正向/反向同步。停用可讓建置略快。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:761
msgid "Elapsed-time counter on the build button"
msgstr "建置按鈕上的計時器"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:764
msgid "Shown automatically for slower interpreters; hidden with PhiTeX live builds."
msgstr "較慢的解譯器自動顯示；PhiTeX 即時建置時隱藏。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:766
msgid "Show once the build passes a second"
msgstr "建置超過一秒後才顯示"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:767
msgid "Always show"
msgstr "一律顯示"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:768
msgid "Never show"
msgstr "永不顯示"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:774
msgid "Auto build"
msgstr "自動建置"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:778
msgid "Automatically build and save after changes"
msgstr "變更後自動建置並儲存"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:779
msgid "When you stop typing, the document is saved and rebuilt after a short delay."
msgstr "當您停止輸入後，文件會在短暫延遲後自動儲存並重新建置。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:783
msgid "Delay (seconds)"
msgstr "延遲（秒）"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:785
msgid "Shorter delays update the preview faster but use more CPU while typing."
msgstr "延遲越短，預覽更新越快，但輸入時會耗用更多 CPU。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:796
msgid "Pop up build log on auto-build errors"
msgstr "自動建置發生錯誤時彈出建置紀錄"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:798
msgid "When auto-build is on, automatically show the build log when errors occur. Disable to avoid interruptions while typing."
msgstr "啟用自動建置時，發生錯誤會自動顯示建置紀錄。停用可避免輸入時受到干擾。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:809
msgid "Automatically show build log"
msgstr "自動顯示建置紀錄…"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:811
msgid "Only when errors occur"
msgstr "僅在出錯時"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:812
msgid "On errors and warnings"
msgstr "出錯或有警告時"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:813
msgid "On errors, warnings and badboxes"
msgstr "出錯、警告或 badbox 時"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:814
msgid "Never"
msgstr "從不"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:820
msgid "Embedded system commands"
msgstr "內嵌系統命令"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:839
msgid "Warning: enable this only if you have to. It can cause security problems when building files from untrusted sources."
msgstr "警告：僅在必要時啟用此選項。建置來自不可信來源的檔案時，可能造成安全問題。"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:847
msgid "System commands"
msgstr "內嵌系統命令"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:849
msgid "Disable"
msgstr "停用"

#: setzer/dialogs/preferences/pages/page_build_system.py:850
